{"id":"word:hebrew:H6921","type":"word","title":"קָדִים","subtitle":"H6921 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the fore or front part; hence (by orientation) the East (often adverbially, eastward , for brevity the east wind )","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קָדִים (H6921) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 69 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קָדִים (qâdîym) means the fore or front part; hence (by orientation) the East (often adverbially, eastward , for brevity the east wind ) First listed occurrence: Exod 10 13."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קָדִים","transliteration":"qâdîym","pronunciation":"kaw-deem'","strong":"H6921","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6921","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["קָדִ֑ים","הַ/קָּדִ֑ים","קָדִ֛ימָ/ה","הַ/קָּדִ֖ים","קָדִ֛ים"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",28],["HNcmsa/Sd",18],["HTd/Ncmsa",17],["HC/Ncmsa/Sd",2],["HTd/Ncmsa/Sd",1],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",1],["HRd/Ncmsa",1],["HR/Td/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"the fore or front part; hence (by orientation) the East (often adverbially, eastward , for brevity the east wind )","usage":"east(-ward, wind).","full":"H6921. qadim קָדִים 69 noun masculine Hosea 13:15 East, east wind ; — absolute ׳ק Gen 41:6 +; with ה locative קָדִ֫ימָה Ezek 11:1 +, קָדִ֫מָה 48:4 +; — 1 (apart from Ezekiel) East , especially (הַ)קּ ׳רוּחַ wind of the East, east wind , often as violent and scorching, from desert on southeast, = Arabic sirocco ( eastern ), compare Dr Amos 4:9 : Exod 10:13 (twice in verse) (JE), 14:21 (J), Jer 18:17 (simile), Jonah 4:8 ; Psa 48:8 ; also ׳ק ( רוּחַ omitted) = east wind Gen 41:6 , 23 , 27 (E), Hosea 12:2 ; 13:15 ; Isa 27:8 ; Job 15:2 ; 27:21 ; 38:24 ; Psa 78:26 . &#8212; קָדִימָה Hab 1:9 is dubious, usually eastward , i.e. forward , but text probably corrupt, compare We Now Da, GASm proposes מַקְדִּים (see also [ מְגַמָּה ] p. 169 above). 2 in Ezekiel (52 t.): a. East הַקּ ׳רוּחַ east wind Ezek 17:10 ; 19:12 ; 27:26 ; east side 42:16 (+ north, south, west); הַקּ ׳שַׁעַר 40:44 (+ north, south); ק ׳מְּאַת 47:18 , + west 48:6-7 , 8 , compare 48:1 ( הַיָּם ׳פ ׳ק ; but read ᵐ5 ׳מִמּ ׳ק פ ׳יְעַד יָמָּה Co Toy and others), + north, south, west, 48:16 ; קּ הַ ׳דֶּרֶךְ i.e. toward the east 40:10 7 t., ׳מִדּ ׳הַקּ 43:2 ; ׳לַקּ 40:23 eastward (+ North) 41:14 ; ׳מֵהַקּ 42:9 on the East. b. קָדִ֫ימָה = East: הַקּ ׳דֶּרֶךְ Ezek 40:6 ; קָדִימָה גְּבוּל 45:7 ; 48:21 (+ west); קָדִימָה מְּאַת 47:18 , + west 48:3 8 t., + north, south, west, 48:32 . c. as adverb קָדִ֫ימָה eastward Ezek 11:1 ; 44:1 ; 47:1 ; + west 45:7 (strike out Berthol Krae), 48:18 , + north, south, west, 48:10 ; 48:17 ; also (הַ)קָּדִים eastward 40:19 ; 43:17 ; 46:1 , 12 ; 47:1 , 3 , + north 47:2 .","rootNote":"or קָדִם ; from 6923 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Exod 10 13","keyReferences":["Exod 10 13","Exod 10 13","Exod 14 21","Ezek 11 1","Ezek 17 10","Ezek 19 12","Ezek 27 26","Ezek 40 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":69,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Exod 10 13","book":"Exod","chapter":10,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קָדִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 10 13","book":"Exod","chapter":10,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/קָּדִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 14 21","book":"Exod","chapter":14,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קָדִ֤ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 11 1","book":"Ezek","chapter":11,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קָדִ֔ימָ/ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa/Sd"},{"reference":"Ezek 17 10","book":"Ezek","chapter":17,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/קָּדִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 19 12","book":"Ezek","chapter":19,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/קָּדִ֖